Alfheim will be out of
action for the time being.

00:08:21.790 --> 00:08:24.580
I'm merely glad the Lilies are safe.

00:08:24.580 --> 00:08:25.950
What about backup?

00:08:25.950 --> 00:08:32.000
The Hitotsuyanagi Squad was unofficially
observing and is temporarily engaging.

00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:36.080
The Hitotsuyanagi Squad...
Wasn't it only just formed?

00:08:36.080 --> 00:08:37.120
Yes.

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:41.330
It has many capable individuals,
but they're all eccentric.

00:08:41.330 --> 00:08:44.750
I wouldn't expect them
to function as a legion yet.

00:08:44.750 --> 00:08:48.500
I doubt they can do more than buy time now.

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:50.660
Synchronize like we practiced!

00:08:50.660 --> 00:08:52.330
R-Right!

00:08:59.410 --> 00:09:01.870
A Huge with old injuries...

00:09:01.870 --> 00:09:03.790
Another Restore?

00:09:14.790 --> 00:09:16.370
What?

00:09:16.370 --> 00:09:18.500
What's that light?

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:25.330
Is that...

00:09:25.330 --> 00:09:27.250
...a CHARM?

00:09:42.330 --> 00:09:46.580
That's... my Dáinsleif.

00:10:01.450 --> 00:10:04.080
Dáinsleif...

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:07.660
Miss Yuyu's stopped moving.

00:10:14.370 --> 00:10:16.290
Yuyu!

00:10:26.160 --> 00:10:27.830
Riri!

00:10:42.250 --> 00:10:44.910
R-Riri...

00:10:44.910 --> 00:10:48.660
Everyone... Where are you?

00:11:06.120 --> 00:11:07.450
Riri...

00:11:07.450 --> 00:11:09.660
Miss Misuzu...

00:11:38.910 --> 00:11:40.870
Yuyu!

00:11:40.870 --> 00:11:43.410
Look how Miss Yuyu is fighting.

00:11:43.410 --> 00:11:45.790
We can't approach her like that.

00:11:45.790 --> 00:11:48.910
What's she thinking, abandoning her Schild?

00:11:48.910 --> 00:11:51.790
Miss Yuyu activated Lunatic Trancer.

00:11:53.450 --> 00:11:56.410
I've got to go!

00:11:56.410 --> 00:11:57.290
Riri!

00:11:57.290 --> 00:11:59.200
Right now, Miss Yuyu is...

00:12:06.120 --> 00:12:07.790
Yuyu!

00:12:11.870 --> 00:12:14.040
Yuyu, please fall back!

00:12:14.040 --> 00:12:16.250
You're covered in cuts!

00:12:19.120 --> 00:12:22.580
Riri, you'd normally have been
cut down two or three times by now!

00:12:22.580 --> 00:12:25.160
Focus on the foe!

00:12:31.290 --> 00:12:36.290
I'm fine. Miss Mai and the others saved me.

00:12:42.290 --> 00:12:45.120
Let's get out of here.

00:12:45.120 --> 00:12:46.950
No.

00:12:46.950 --> 00:12:51.870
That Dáinsleif belongs to me and Misuzu!

00:12:51.870 --> 00:12:54.370
So...

00:12:54.370 --> 00:12:56.120
Yuyu!

00:12:58.370 --> 00:12:59.580
Go, Riri!

00:12:59.580 --> 00:13:02.200
Sorry, I'll be right back.

00:13:02.200 --> 00:13:03.910
Just wait for me a little--

00:13:03.910 --> 00:13:05.250
Ow!

00:13:05.250 --> 00:13:06.750
Are you okay, Riri?!

00:13:06.750 --> 00:13:08.870
I'm fine!

00:13:08.870 --> 00:13:10.580
Is she really?

00:13:10.580 --> 00:13:11.700
Did she say "wait"?

00:13:11.700 --> 00:13:14.250
I'm sure she meant "hold out."

00:13:14.250 --> 00:13:17.080
Our leader works us hard.

00:13:17.080 --> 00:13:20.910
What shall we do?
Trade places with yet another legion?

00:13:20.910 --> 00:13:22.250
You must be joking!

00:13:22.250 --> 00:13:24.830
Our leader ordered us to hold out or die.

00:13:24.830 --> 00:13:29.040
I don't think she asked us to go
that far, but I'm with Kaede!

00:13:29.040 --> 00:13:31.290
That Huge hasn't mastered the CHARM.

00:13:31.290 --> 00:13:34.250
It's burning itself with flames of Magie.

00:13:34.250 --> 00:13:37.830
If Miss Yuyu comes back, we can win.

00:13:41.910 --> 00:13:45.120
Knowledge of Magie was brought about by Huge.

00:13:45.120 --> 00:13:49.870
That's what gave humans
the power to resist the Huge.

00:13:49.870 --> 00:13:54.500
It's said that Lilies are humans
who have become Huge.

00:13:54.500 --> 00:13:55.790
With one difference:

00:13:55.790 --> 00:14:03.620
Only we Lilies keep our hearts
and aren't controlled by Magie.

00:14:03.620 --> 00:14:09.540
That's the only thing that definitively
separates Lilies and Huge.

00:14:12.040 --> 00:14:13.830
Yuyu,

00:14:13.830 --> 00:14:16.080
remember who you are.

00:14:25.250 --> 00:14:26.830
Yuyu...

00:14:28.620 --> 00:14:30.870
Don't look, Riri.

00:14:31.870 --> 00:14:34.450
Don't look at me.

00:14:34.450 --> 00:14:39.500
Lunatic Trancer shouldn't
even be called a Rare Skill.

00:14:39.500 --> 00:14:43.080
It's just a curse.

00:14:43.080 --> 00:14:44.830
I hate.

00:14:44.830 --> 00:14:47.080
I come to hate everything.

00:14:47.080 --> 00:14:53.250
I get consumed by hatred and can't
help hurting everything around me.

00:14:53.250 --> 00:14:57.290
I'm under a curse.

00:14:57.290 --> 00:15:00.500
I'm the one who killed Miss Misuzu.

00:15:00.500 --> 00:15:04.080
I did it with my own hands.

00:15:04.080 --> 00:15:07.540
With that Dáinsleif.

00:15:07.540 --> 00:15:09.660
Pull yourself together, Yuyu!

00:15:09.660 --> 00:15:10.620
No!

00:15:10.620 --> 00:15:12.500
I'm no different from a Huge!

00:15:12.500 --> 00:15:13.330
Miss Yuyu!

00:15:13.330 --> 00:15:14.870
No, stay back.

00:15:14.870 --> 00:15:16.620
Look at me!

00:15:16.620 --> 00:15:19.620
Miss Misuzu fought the Huge!

00:15:21.160 --> 00:15:22.790
It's not your fault, Yuyu!

00:15:22.790 --> 00:15:24.830
You can't know that!

00:15:24.830 --> 00:15:26.250
I do!

00:15:26.250 --> 00:15:31.080
You could never hurt someone
you care about so much!

00:15:37.950 --> 00:15:41.290
I can't protect you!

00:15:41.290 --> 00:15:44.950
I'm not worthy to be your Schutzengel!

00:15:46.870 --> 00:15:49.580
I didn't want to be alone.

00:15:49.580 --> 00:15:52.660
It was just the only way I could be.

00:15:52.660 --> 00:15:56.040
I'm completely worthless.

00:15:56.040 --> 00:16:01.700
Making a Schutzengel pledge
with you made me really happy!

00:16:01.700 --> 00:16:03.620
I don't understand.

00:16:03.620 --> 00:16:07.540
I can't understand how you feel.

00:16:07.540 --> 00:16:11.120
How could you be happy to be loved by me?

00:16:11.120 --> 00:16:14.540
I'm sure Miss Misuzu was the same as me!

00:16:14.540 --> 00:16:16.290
What would you know?!

00:16:16.290 --> 00:16:18.750
I don't know, but I do!

00:16:21.290 --> 00:16:27.540
If you activate Lunatic Trancer,
Yuyu, I'll stop you again.

00:16:27.540 --> 00:16:29.500
As many times as it takes.

00:16:29.500 --> 00:16:31.870
No matter what.

00:16:31.870 --> 00:16:35.580
Even if you stab me.

00:16:35.580 --> 00:16:37.370
So...

00:16:43.250 --> 00:16:46.160
Thank you, Riri.

00:16:50.580 --> 00:16:53.120
All right, Yuyu.

00:16:58.500 --> 00:17:00.620
The Huge has two arms left.

00:17:00.620 --> 00:17:05.080
The tips are deployed at the
intersection of Omachi 3rd and 6th!

00:17:10.040 --> 00:17:13.040
We'll get that Dáinsleif back!

00:17:13.040 --> 00:17:14.200
Naturally!

00:17:14.200 --> 00:17:17.540
A Huge using a CHARM is unthinkable!

00:17:25.160 --> 00:17:27.660
Oh, crap!

00:17:27.660 --> 00:17:28.370
--You guys!

00:17:28.370 --> 00:17:29.830
--Let's hurry!
--You guys!

00:17:33.830 --> 00:17:35.870
I want some spotlight!

00:17:37.830 --> 00:17:39.870
I-I have to join in.

00:17:39.870 --> 00:17:42.250
--Hang on!
--Wait!

00:17:42.250 --> 00:17:44.000
Riri! Miss Yuyu!

00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:46.410
Stay there, Fumi!

00:17:51.040 --> 00:17:52.790
It's out!

00:17:59.500 --> 00:18:00.750
We got it back.

00:18:00.750 --> 00:18:03.000
We held our ground, as you ordered.

00:18:03.000 --> 00:18:06.040
A-Are you all okay?

00:18:06.040 --> 00:18:09.540
This was in that Huge?

00:18:09.540 --> 00:18:13.410
This really is Yuyu's old Dáinsleif.

00:18:13.410 --> 00:18:16.160
I recognize the scratches.

00:18:16.160 --> 00:18:18.540
Yes.

00:18:18.540 --> 00:18:21.410
It's still moving.

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:23.580
Umm...

00:18:23.580 --> 00:18:26.660
Should we try it?

00:18:26.660 --> 00:18:28.450
Try what?

00:18:29.700 --> 00:18:32.790
The Neunwelt Tactic.

00:18:32.790 --> 00:18:36.120
Miss Mai, would you start?

00:18:36.120 --> 00:18:40.330
I'm worried I might screw it up.

00:18:40.330 --> 00:18:44.370
Our leader works us hard.

00:18:44.370 --> 00:18:48.120
Then, my partner will be...

00:18:48.120 --> 00:18:50.580
Huh? M-Me?!

00:18:50.580 --> 00:18:53.370
Okay, Fumin, shoot.

00:18:56.040 --> 00:18:57.700
What are you doing?!

00:18:57.700 --> 00:18:58.870
What should I shoot?!

00:18:58.870 --> 00:19:00.410
You don't mean the Huge?!

00:19:00.410 --> 00:19:02.200
I mean me. Come on, shoot.

00:19:02.200 --> 00:19:03.120
What?!

00:19:03.120 --> 00:19:04.700
Are you crazy, Miss Mai?!

00:19:04.700 --> 00:19:06.330
I've never practiced shooting a per--

00:19:06.330 --> 00:19:07.540
Hurry up!

00:19:07.540 --> 00:19:09.160
Okay!

00:19:13.580 --> 00:19:16.500
A Magie sphere!

00:19:16.500 --> 00:19:20.620
I can feel it! So, this is your Magie!

00:19:20.620 --> 00:19:21.620
Okay, next...

00:19:21.620 --> 00:19:23.540
Huh?! Me?!

00:19:23.540 --> 00:19:26.330
Get your CHARM out, Wang-Wang!

00:19:29.580 --> 00:19:31.830
Miss Mai, you're too close!

00:19:31.830 --> 00:19:34.500
Yuyu and Riri did this before.

00:19:34.500 --> 00:19:37.330
The pass won't miss this way!

00:19:37.330 --> 00:19:39.200
This isn't in the textbook!

00:19:39.200 --> 00:19:42.250
Excellent! Send it my way next!

00:19:42.250 --> 00:19:43.750
Don't be so greedy.

00:19:43.750 --> 00:19:47.410
Aim carefully, Tazusa!

00:19:47.410 --> 00:19:50.120
Sorry if I cut you.

00:19:51.830 --> 00:19:55.000
Here, Shenlin.

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:57.700
Couldn't you be gentler?

00:19:58.950 --> 00:20:02.620
Be careful! It's stronger than I thought.

00:20:02.620 --> 00:20:05.120
Just the way I like it!

00:20:08.750 --> 00:20:12.370
Accept my feelings, Riri!

00:20:12.370 --> 00:20:15.200
Y-You mean everyone's, right?

00:20:17.700 --> 00:20:20.910
Was my love too strong?!

00:20:23.410 --> 00:20:24.910
No, it's at its limit.

00:20:24.910 --> 00:20:27.160
It's only natural.

00:20:27.160 --> 00:20:29.000
Riri, come here!

00:20:29.000 --> 00:20:30.660
Yuyu!

00:20:33.950 --> 00:20:35.950
We'll go in just like this.

00:20:35.950 --> 00:20:37.290
Right!

00:20:39.450 --> 00:20:42.160
Don't worry, you can do it.

00:20:42.160 --> 00:20:43.540
Right!

00:20:53.660 --> 00:20:55.120
Riri.

00:20:56.540 --> 00:21:00.040
I believe in you.

00:21:00.040 --> 00:21:02.540
Yuyu?

00:21:02.540 --> 00:21:03.540
What are you doing?!

00:21:03.540 --> 00:21:06.040
Get clear of there quick!

00:21:59.950 --> 00:22:02.950
"To be continued"

00:23:33.700 --> 00:23:35.120
Sorry, Moyu.

00:23:35.120 --> 00:23:38.290
We know you're busy, but we broke our CHARMs.

00:23:38.290 --> 00:23:39.290
Say "ah"!

00:23:39.290 --> 00:23:40.200
"Alfheim first year" "Tanaka Ichi"
"Arsenal Division second year" "Mashima Moyu"

00:23:40.200 --> 00:23:45.700
"Alfheim first year" "Tanaka Ichi"
"Arsenal Division second year" "Mashima Moyu"

00:23:40.200 --> 00:23:45.700
That was some Huge, manipulating
a CHARM to neutralize Neunwelt!

00:23:45.700 --> 00:23:46.250
"Alfheim first year" "Tanaka Ichi"
"Arsenal Division second year" "Mashima Moyu"

00:23:45.700 --> 00:23:46.250
We're really sorry. Have some of this, too.

00:23:46.250 --> 00:23:49.080
We're really sorry. Have some of this, too.

00:23:49.080 --> 00:23:55.700
But was the CHARM really the only
reason the Huge's capabilities grew?

00:23:55.700 --> 00:24:02.290
And how did a Huge use a CHARM,
which shouldn't work without a pact?

